Subject: [PATCH 2/2] WALLET: Redesign onboarding to Seed-First (Option B)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Changed flow from PIN-first to Seed-Phrase-first:
- Initial screen: seedPhraseScreen (auto-generated, displayed)
- User writes down seed phrase (required step)
- Confirmation: User verifies by selecting correct words
- Only after verification: PIN setup screen (not skippable)
- Final: Wallet created from seed + PIN

Benefits:
✓ User sees entropy source (auto-generated seed phrase)
✓ User has control (writes it down, verifies it)
✓ Transparent security model (seed + PIN = full access)
✓ Enterprise confidence: deliberate, secure sequence
✓ No black boxes: everything user-verified

Also removed emoji (📚) from recovery phrase screen.
Updated button text to 'Seed Verified — Proceed to PIN' (professional).
Premium gradient styling on confirmation screen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
